sense_provider_metadata.etymology_text:
From Natal (“Christmas”):
* The region in South Africa was discovered by the Portuguese navigator Vasco da Gama on Christmas Day, 1497;
* The capital of Rio Grande do Norte was founded in 25 December 1599.

